    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within Cill Cluain, this architecturally designed three-bedroom property forms part of an attractive development of just eight detached homes. This mature residential development enjoys a convenient setting just outside Louisburgh, along the main Westport–Louisburgh Road and is only a few minutes’ walk from the town.                                                                                                                                                                   The property is presented in turnkey condition, with a high standard of finish throughout and well-proportioned contemporary accommodation. High-gloss tiled and wooden flooring, shaker-style doors, high ceilings and a contemporary fitted kitchen are among the features that contribute to the home's modern and comfortable interior. The property has been maintained to a high standard and offers all the modern comforts associated with a newer home.                                                                                                                               On entering, an open-plan hallway leads through to the dining room, where a high ceiling and extensive glazing create a bright and spacious setting. This is a particularly adaptable area that could easily be arranged to meet the requirements of its new owner. Positioned on the opposite side is the generously proportioned sitting room, featuring solid wooden flooring and an open fire with a cream marble surround and black granite hearth. The room provides an inviting setting for both everyday relaxation and entertaining.                                                                                                                                                                                    To the rear of the property is the kitchen, which is accessed through a glazed opening that allows excellent natural light into the space. The fully fitted high-gloss kitchen incorporates wood-effect worktops together with an integrated cooker, hob and dishwasher. Sliding doors lead directly from the kitchen to the rear garden. A spacious utility room is also located on the ground floor and includes fitted units and a sink, together with plumbing for a washing machine and dryer. It also provides an alternative access point to the garden. A W.C. completes the ground-floor accommodation.                                                                                              The first floor comprises three generously sized bedrooms, each benefiting from fitted wardrobes. The master bedroom includes a fully tiled shower room, while a hot press provides useful additional storage. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation at this level.                                                                     Outside, a cobble-lock driveway provides off-street parking to the front of the property. The low-maintenance rear garden can be accessed from both sides of the house and is enclosed to the rear. Cill Cluain is positioned on the Westport Road, approximately 600 metres from Louisburgh town. The development features a tarmacadam access road, footpaths and street lighting and has matured well in recent years. Combining a convenient location with contemporary architectural design, mains services, pleasant countryside and Croagh Patrick views, and a high energy rating, the property is suited to a variety of potential purchasers, including first-time buyers, those seeking a holiday or retirement home, and purchasers wishing to relocate to this popular residential location."
      },
